# Persistent browser profiles. They live under %LOCALAPPDATA% by design and
# should never appear here at all -- this rule exists so that a developer who
# points LUMI_BROWSER_PROFILE_ROOT at the checkout cannot commit a directory
# full of live session cookies. The build fails if one reaches dist/ as well.
browser-profiles/

